鮮甜不死鹹也不會有很重的柴魚味，混入干貝絲後風味又提升一層。\n最後吃辣的人超級推薦吃一半後加吧臺上的辣醬，辣度不高但香味複雜有層次，能直接改變整碗麵的風味，好吃到我覺得老闆該推出一款加辣醬的湯頭。",null,[0,89]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3713799685916422937/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVHUzJWcmNGUmpXRVp3V1ZWT1NsSnNaRkJXYkZKV1pVaFpNVlZWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7774,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GS2VrcFRjWEZwWVVOSlJsZFBWbFJWZUhZMVVVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x176855746c2bbda0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnFKekpTcXFpYUNJRldPVlRVeHY1UUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GS2VrcFRjWEZwWVVOSlJsZFBWbFJWZUhZMVVVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GS2VrcFRjWEZwWVVOSlJsZFBWbFJWZUhZMVVVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25GS2VrcFRjWEZwWVVOSlJsZFBWbFJWZUhZMVVVRRILMGU2My1VTVJsaHYaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uRktla3BUY1hGcFlVTkpSbGRQVmxSVmVIWTFVVUUSCzBlNjMtVU1SbGh2IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARoL0rbHRVaBcqCzBlNjMtVU1SbGh2\u0026